cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite scikit-maad (below), which performs all of the analysis."
type: software
title: "Scikit-Maad GUI (scikit-maad-biosound)"
abstract: "A point-and-click graphical interface built on the open-source scikit-maad Python package for batch-processing marine passive acoustic recordings. It calculates more than 60 acoustic indices with scikit-maad, exports results as CSV files, and creates correlation maps and false-color spectrograms."
authors:
  - name: "Ocean Science Analytics, LLC"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ocean-Science-Analytics/scikit-maad-biosound"
url: "https://www.oceanscienceanalytics.com/bioacoustic-resources"
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-15
keywords:
  - "soundscape ecology"
  - "acoustic indices"
  - "scikit-maad"
  - "bioacoustics"
  - "Python"
  - "GUI"
